/src/aws/services/

# Protocol-test dispatcher modules STAY in git for now: the
# generator picks up every `build_<op>_request` it finds in the
# service module, which surfaces latent codec gaps as test failures
# for restXml ops we haven't unblocked yet. Until those gaps close,
# the committed dispatchers are the hand-curated subset exercising
# only green codepaths.
# (regen via `python3 scripts/emit-dispatchers.py ...` when ready —
#  see scripts/regen.sh for the full invocation.)
